# almasix-permission

Standalone Almasix RBAC package. Full Spatie Laravel Permission v8 *feature*
target without Spatie branding in docs. Not an Almasix PLAN/SMOKE/progress
milestone — own tests and `make test-cov` ≥98% on `almasix.permission`.

## Namespaces (do not regress)

- Dist: `almasix-permission`
- Import: `almasix.permission` under `src/almasix/permission/` (PEP 420; no
  `src/almasix/__init__.py`)
- Config key in apps: `permission.*` via `config("permission…")` — never
  `config("almasix.permission…")`
- Provider entry: `almasix.permission.provider:PermissionServiceProvider`
- GitHub: `almasix-dev/permission`; local dir: `almasix-permission`

Migrations: slug-only sources; timestamps only on publish. Prefer fixing
coverage/tests in this repo over changing the almasix core for package demos.
